ary mailbox on day one. You can also use social and other non-email channels right away."},{id:"who-sends-emails",question:"Who does Ava send emails as?",answer:"Ava sends from your team’s email addresses. To prospects, it looks like outreach from your company."},{id:"reply-and-book",question:"Can Ava actually reply to prospects and book meetings?",answer:"Yes. Ava reads replies, handles objections, answers questions, and schedules meetings directly on your team's calendar to streamline the sales process. Your reps only talk to qualified, interested prospects."},{id:"make-calls",question:"Can Ava make calls?",answer:"No. Ava cannot legally make calls, she creates a list of qualified prospects for your reps to dial and shows full context and talking points on each lead."},{id:"sends-wrong",question:"What if Ava sends something wrong?",answer:"You can review and approve all outreach before it goes out. Most teams start with approvals enabled, then go fully autonomous once they trust Ava's judgment."},{id:"crm-integration",question:"Does Ava integrate with my CRM?",answer:"Ava integrates with Salesforce and HubSpot and syncs data in real time so your team always has an up-to-date view of every contact and account."}]},5031,(e,t,a)=>{t.exports=[{id:"free-trial",question:"How does the free trial work?",answer:"Each new account starts with a 10K credit free trial (~$300 in value) and 30 days to use them. You get access to all features with no credit card required. The 10K credit grant is available to new customers only and limited to one per company (additional teammates share the existing trial). If you don't enter a credit card by the end of the trial, your account automatically downgrades to the Free plan, and all campaigns will be paused. Credits cannot be transferred or redeemed for cash."},{id:"credits-how",question:"What are credits and how do they work?",answer:"Credits power Ava's work, from finding and enriching leads to personalizing outreach and handling replies. Simpler actions like email enrichment cost less; more intensive ones like deploying swarms of research agents cost more. Your plan includes a credit allocation that covers each billing period. Sending infrastructure like mailboxes and phone numbers is billed separately in dollars."},{id:"campaign-credits",question:"How many credits does a typical campaign use?",answer:"It depends on your campaign type, the channels you use, how much personalization you want, and the length of your sequence, so it's quite flexible. Most campaigns start at around 20 credits per prospect enrolled, covering enrichment and outreach. Bringing your own lead list or using templated messages costs less; using advanced signals and longer, ultra-personalized sequences costs more."},{id:"pick-plan",question:"How do I pick the right plan?",answer:"Start with the campaign type you'll run and how many leads you want to reach each month. Use the Credits Estimator to see roughly how many credits that requires, then pick the plan that covers it. You can always upgrade as you scale without losing any data."},{id:"annual-upfront",question:"If I'm on an annual plan, do I get all my credits upfront?",answer:"Yes! Annual plans give you your entire credit allocation at the start of your term, so you have full flexibility to use them whenever you need throughout the year."},{id:"run-out",question:"What happens if I run out of credits?",answer:"You'll get a warning as your balance gets low. Credits for each lead are spent when the lead is enrolled, so sequences already in progress will continue uninterrupted. New enrollments pause when credits are exhausted so there are no surprise charges. You can purchase additional credits instantly to resume, or upgrade to a higher plan at any time."},{id:"rollover",question:"Do unused credits roll over?",answer:"On monthly plans, unused credits carry over until the end of the following billing period. On annual plans, you receive your full credit allocation upfront, and any unused credits at the end of your term do not roll over."},{id:"upgrade-downgrade",question:"Can I upgrade or downgrade at any time?",answer:"Yes. Upgrades take effect immediately and you get instant access to the additional credits. Downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing cycle, and you can cancel a pending downgrade any time before it kicks in."},{id:"free-plan",question:"What's included in the Free plan?",answer:"The Free plan gives you 300 credits/month to explore the platform. You can search leads, run enrichments, and use agent swarm research. Campaigns, deliverability tools, and integrations require a paid plan (Intern or above)."}]},58352,(e,t,a)=>{t.exports=[{id:"how-does-pricing-work",question:"How does pricing work?",answer:"Plans are sized to your lead volume, mailboxes, and dialer seats. Request pricing and we'll build the right plan with you."},{id:"implementation",question:"What does implementation look like?",answer:"Every plan starts with onboarding sessions and CSM support in a shared Slack channel. Scale adds a dedicated CSM, and Enterprise adds a forward-deployed strategist who builds and launches your rollout with you."},{id:"the-demo",question:"What happens in the demo?",answer:"A 30-minute walkthrough of how Ava would run your outbound, tailored to your ICP and current stack. We'll scope the right plan together."},{id:"control-what-ava-sends",question:"Can we control what Ava sends?",answer:"Yes. Approve before sending, lock tone and CTAs, set banned phrases, and coach Ava's writing. Autonomous by default, adjustable by design."},{id:"who-does-ava-send-as",question:"Who does Ava send emails as?",answer:"Ava sends in your reps' names, from your own sending domains, so outreach reads like it came from them. Ava handles the replies, your reps get the meetings."},{id:"secure-and-compliant",question:"Is Artisan secure and compliant?",answer:"Artisan is SOC 2 Type II certified and supports SSO / SAML, advanced security controls, and audit logs."},{id:"integrations",question:"Which tools does Ava integrate with?",answer:"Salesforce and HubSpot sync bi-directionally, custom webhooks bring in your own data, and Slack keeps your team on top of performance."},{id:"replace-bdr-team",question:"Does Ava replace our BDR team?",answer:"Ava runs the repetitive outbound work, finding leads, writing outreach, handling replies, so your reps spend their time on live conversations. You set the guardrails: approvals, escalation rules, and when a human steps in."}]},48910,48861,e=>{"use strict";var t=e.i(70686);e.i(79091);var a=e.i(44538),i=e.i(65231),s=e.i(79371),l=e.i(15745),r=e.i(2178),n=e.i(89493),o=e.i(84069),d=e.i(62897),c=e.i(73208);e.i(25807);var m=e.i(90156),p=e.i(23645),u=e.i(13894),h=e.i(76452),g=e.i(16959),x=e.i(65677),b=e.i(14744);let y=({feature:e,billing:a})=>{if("kind"in e&&"powerDialer"===e.kind)return(0,t.jsxs)("li",{className:"flex gap-1.5 items-start",children:[(0,t.jsx)(c.AiCheck,{className:"shrink-0 text-primary-600","aria-hidden":"true",width:20,height:20}),(0,t.jsx)("div",{className:"min-w-0 flex-1",children:(0,t.jsx)("div",{className:"caption-xsmall text-left text-neutral-950/70 sm:desktop-body-small",children:(0,i.formatPowerDialerFeatureLabel)(a)})})]});let{text:s,suffixBadge:l}=e;return(0,t.jsxs)("li",{className:"flex gap-1.5 items-start",children:[(0,t.jsx)(c.AiCheck,{className:"shrink-0 text-primary-600","aria-hidden":"true",width:20,height:20}),(0,t.jsx)("div",{className:"min-w-0 flex-1",children:(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"caption-xsmall text-left text-neutral-950/70 sm:desktop-body-small",children:[s,l&&(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[" ",(0,t.jsx)(p.Tag,{label:l,size:"xs",style:"oval",className:(0,r.cn)("inline-flex align-middle","pointer-events-none shrink-0 cursor-default border border-primary-200 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700","hover:bg-primary-100 hover:text-primary-700 active:bg-primary-100 active:text-primary-700")})]})]})})]})},f=(e,t,a)=>{if(a!==g.Route.Pr